Linus,

please pull ALSA updates for v2.6.30-rc5 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains the following trivial fixes.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Clemens Ladisch (2):
      sound: serial-u16550: fix buffer overflow
      sound: via82xx: fix DXS volume range

Jaroslav Kysela (1):
      ALSA: Release v1.0.20

Jinyoung Park (1):
      ASoC: Fix errors in WM8990

Takashi Iwai (1):
      ALSA: hda - Fix line-in on Mac Mini Core2 Duo

